noir/internal/bignum
  A modified copy of noir-lang/noir-bignum v0.11.0 (commit
  c2767065cc9012e1b6201edec14acc92cb2a4a68),
  https://github.com/noir-lang/noir-bignum, Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).
  Changes: exact three-limb equality and inequality checks, tightened
  quadratic-expression hint validation, the narrow-tail and fixed-bias carry
  specialisations described in docs/OPTIMISATIONS.md, added tests, and the
  upstream benchmark module removed.

noir/internal/bigcurve_fixed, noir/internal/bigcurve_runtime_signed
  Two modified copies of noir-lang/noir_bigcurve at commit
  da39a08d8999f56cf5631f61ae9ffc06dd0302b9,
  https://github.com/noir-lang/noir_bigcurve. Changes common to both include
  a distinct-x guard in incomplete addition, corrected add_with_hint operand
  signs, additional tests and the upstream benchmark module removed (the
  sources are the record of every change). bigcurve_fixed adds the
  selected-offset fixed-base MSM used by noir/groth16;
  bigcurve_runtime_signed adds the signed MSM used by the runtime-key
  verifier.
  Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE). The copied revision predates the upstream licence
  file, which was added in commit 04b663b.

